      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 552,
        "height": 656,
        "content": "## Run a personalised onboarding email drip with Gemini and Wait nodes\n\n### How it works\nGeneric onboarding emails get ignored. This template sends a short, personalised three-email series timed over a week, using Wait nodes to space it out. When someone signs up through the built-in form and shares their goal, a Basic LLM Chain with Google Gemini writes a warm welcome email tailored to that goal and sends it immediately. A Wait node pauses the execution for two days, then Gemini writes a tips email with concrete next steps and sends it. Another Wait of three days later, Gemini writes a friendly check-in that invites a reply. The signup is logged to Google Sheets. Because each email is generated at send time, it always reflects the person's stated goal.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect Google Gemini (PaLM) API, Gmail and Google Sheets.\n2. In Set Product Context, enter your product name, value and sender.\n3. Adjust the Wait intervals to your preferred cadence.\n\n### Customization tips\nAdd a branch that stops the series if the person replies or converts."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
