        "width": 856,
        "height": 676,
        "content": "## 1. Signup & welcome (Basic LLM Chain)\nThe form captures the goal; Gemini writes a tailored welcome and sends it immediately. The signup is logged."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ebf13fbd-98a1-4cfc-b7d5-cf04bcdcc411",
